sequenceDiagram
    %% Define the Offline Environment Box
    box rgba(38, 21, 161, 0.2) Offline
        participant D as Datasets
        participant R as Dataset Runs
        participant OE as Offline Evals
    end

    %% Define the Online Environment Box
    box rgba(5, 201, 41, 0.39) Online
        participant OB as Observability
        participant ONE as Online Evals
    end

    %% Offline Phase Interactions
    Note over D: • Happy path<br>• Edge cases<br>• Adversarial Input
    D->>R: Loop Application through Datasets
    
    Note over R: • Test model, prompt, tool,<br>code changes
    R->>OE: Execute Evaluations
    
    Note over OE: • Manual Annotation<br>• LLM-as-a-Judge<br>• Custom via API/SDK
    OE-->>R: Fix Issues (Local Loop)
    
    %% Transition to Online
    OE->>OB: Deploy
    
    %% Online Phase Interactions
    Note over OB: • Capture Traces<br>• Debugging<br>• Manual Review
    OB->>ONE: Monitor Output
    
    Note over ONE: • Manual Annotation<br>• LLM-as-a-Judge<br>• Custom via API/SDK<br>• User Feedback
    
    %% Feedback Loops back to Offline
    ONE-->>R: Fix Issues (Production Bug)
    ONE->>D: Add Test cases from real data